Announcement that due to the Memorial Day holiday on Monday, May 27, 2024, the regularly scheduled City Council meeting will instead be held on Tuesday, May 28, 2024.  The meeting will be held at 2101 O’Neil Avenue in City Council Chambers and via electronic conference meeting at 6:00 p.m.
d)
Announcement of a Public Hearing to be held May 28, 2024 at 6:00 p.m. in City Council Chambers, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, WY, and via electronic conference meeting, to hear public comment regarding the City’s intent to apply for a 2024 Wyoming Business Council Business Ready Community Grant and Loan Program for a Community Readiness Project for essential infrastructure at the Precision Industrial Park.
